<title>USA: Neogen files for proposed offering.</title>
<headline>Neogen files for proposed offering.</headline>
<dateline>LANSING, Mich. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Neogen Corp said it filed a registration statement with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for a proposed public offering of 1.5 million common shares.</p>
<p>All of the stock is being offered by Neogen, which makes diagnostic test kits and other products for the agricultural, pharmacologic and environmental industries.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering will be used for possible acquisitions and licensing of products or technologies.</p>
<p>The offering is being co-managed by Roney &amp; Co in Detroit.</p>
